# Culture Amp

> Culture Amp is the market-leading employee experience platform, combining performance management, employee engagement, and development tools with People Science, AI, and the world's largest employee dataset. Used by 6,000+ companies.

## Platform

- [Platform overview](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform): The full Culture Amp platform — Engage, Perform, and AI Coach together.
- [Engage](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform/engage): Employee engagement surveys, DEI surveys, pulse surveys, benchmarking, and action planning.
- [Perform](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform/perform): Performance reviews, continuous feedback, 1-on-1s, goal management, and skills coaching.
- [AI Coach](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform/ai-coach): AI-driven coaching and insights layered across Engage and Perform.
- [Plans & pricing](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform/plans-and-pricing): Pricing tiers and plan comparison.
- [Integrations & API](https://www.cultureamp.com/platform/integrations): Supported HRIS/SaaS integrations and developer API.

## Solutions

- [HR Executives (CHRO)](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/chro): Value proposition for CHROs and senior HR leadership.
- [HR Leaders](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/hr-director): Value proposition for HR directors and people leaders.
- [CFOs](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/cfo): Business case and ROI framing for finance leaders.
- [CIOs](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/cio): IT/security/integration framing for technology leaders.
- [Professional Services](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/professional-services): Industry-specific messaging for professional services firms.
- [Financial Services](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/financial-services): Industry-specific messaging for financial services firms.
- [Software & Technology](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/software-technology): Industry-specific messaging for tech companies.
- [Manufacturing](https://www.cultureamp.com/solutions/manufacturing): Industry-specific messaging for manufacturing companies.

## Science

- [People Science](https://www.cultureamp.com/science/people-science): Culture Amp's research-backed methodology behind the product.
- [Research](https://www.cultureamp.com/science/research): Published research and evidence-based practices.
- [Benchmarks](https://www.cultureamp.com/science/insights): Employee experience benchmark data drawn from Culture Amp's dataset.
- [ROI Calculator](https://www.cultureamp.com/science/roi-calculator): Interactive tool for quantifying the business case for culture investment.

